### Conclusion

The set $S \cap \{1, 2, \ldots, 20\} = \{9, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 20\}$.

The sum is:
$$9 + 12 + 13 + 14 + 15 + 16 + 17 + 18 + 19 + 20 = 9 + \frac{9 \cdot (12+20)}{2} = 9 + 144 = \boxed{153}$$

